1
00:00:01,340 --> 00:00:03,115
老妈 快点 我还得上学呢
Mom, come on, I need to get to school!

2
00:00:03,115 --> 00:00:05,100
今天不是高四逃课日吗
Isn't it today Senior Ditch Day?

3
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:05,979
今天是逃课日吗
Today's Ditch Day?

4
00:00:05,979 --> 00:00:07,937
逃课日你绝对不能错过
No way you are ditching Ditch Day.

5
00:00:07,937 --> 00:00:10,800
这是高四最棒的一周...一天
It's like the best week of senior year...day.

6
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:11,960
不像我们家
Unlike this house,

7
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,060
图书馆会非常安静
the library will be completely quiet

8
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:16,040
我就可以专心选室友了
So I can focus on my roommate selection.

9
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:18,159
选一个书呆子舍友能花多少时间
How long can picking a nerdy roommate take?

10
00:00:18,159 --> 00:00:19,280
她们就是你的不同版本罢了
They're all versions of you.

11
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:22,558
印度版的你 金发版的你 亚裔版的你
Look -- Indian you, blonde you, Asian you.

12
00:00:22,558 --> 00:00:24,540
快看 她的名字就叫钰[音同你]
Oh, look! Her name is actually "Yu".

13
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:26,760
逃一天课不会怎么样的
Skipping one day of school isn't gonna do any harm.

14
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:28,680
我就逃了很多课 看看我现在
I ditched plenty, and look at me today.

15
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:31,080
我得到了很多工作机会
I am fielding multiple job offers.

16
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:31,900
只有一个
One job offer.

17
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,960
是一个著名的连锁酒店
From a very prominent hotel chain

18
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:36,874
我要在它和现在的工作之间权衡
weighed against the implied offer of staying at my current job.

19
00:00:36,874 --> 00:00:38,460
现在的工作是给你爸打工
Working for you dad.

20
00:00:38,460 --> 00:00:40,120
没错 而我不能离开外公
Exactly! And I could never leave grandpa,

21
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:42,300
所以我要拒绝第一个工作机会
so I am going to say "No" to the first offer --

22
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:42,860
唯一一个
Only offer.

23
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:44,380
即便我完全可以胜任
Even though I would have made an excellent

24
00:00:44,380 --> 00:00:46,300
分管销售的地区副总裁职务
regional vice president in charge of promotions.

25
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:48,440
她确实很擅长推销
She is great at promotion.

26
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:50,620
那职位名被她越说越长了
That title gets longer every time I hear it.

27
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:52,279
拜托 别去学校了
Come on, don't go to school.

28
00:00:52,279 --> 00:00:54,140
姐妹日 我们一起去逛商场
Girls' day! We'll swing by the mall.

29
00:00:54,140 --> 00:00:55,360
你的全身衣物都需要换新的了
You could use a new everything.

30
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:58,120
姑娘们 快上车 卢克受伤了
Girls, get in the car. Luke's hurt.

31
00:00:58,120 --> 00:00:59,260
天呐 发生了什么
Oh, my God. What happened?

32
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:00,180
他上学路上晕倒了
He collapsed on the way to school.

33
00:01:00,280 --> 00:01:01,900
现在在医院里 快点
He's in the hospital. Come on.

34
00:01:02,487 --> 00:01:04,120
卢克怎么了 他怎么会晕倒
What's wrong with Luke? Why'd he collapsed?

35
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:05,200
我听说他死了
I heard he was dead!

36
00:01:06,680 --> 00:01:07,675
原来你们这么关心我
You care about me.

37
00:01:07,675 --> 00:01:08,920
把她们耍得团团转 伙计
Got 'em good, buddy.

38
00:01:08,920 --> 00:01:09,860
没人死了
Nobody's dead!

39
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:11,500
-小心 -对不起
- Look out! - Oh, sorry!

40
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:13,120
你疯了吗
Are you out of your mind?!

41
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:16,260
艾丽克斯 你这一年简直学疯了
Alex, you have worked so insanely hard this year.

42
00:01:16,260 --> 00:01:18,300
你比任何人都该享受逃课日
You deserve this Ditch Day more than anyone.

43
00:01:18,740 --> 00:01:20,020
所以你猜怎么着
So guess what?

44
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:22,020
我们要去加州冒险乐园[迪士尼乐园]
We're going to California Adventure.

45
00:01:22,600 --> 00:01:23,480
不带老妈
Without mom!

46
00:01:24,980 --> 00:01:27,680
逃课日 逃课日 逃课日
Ditch Day! Ditch Day! Ditch Day!

47
00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:29,460
这是你们的什么盛大节日吗
Is this a high holiday for you people?

48
00:01:43,780 --> 00:01:45,340
没错 我下定决心了
That's it. I'm doing it.

49
00:01:45,380 --> 00:01:47,960
我要把所有的袜子都扔掉 重新开始
I'm throwing out all my socks and starting over.

50
00:01:48,080 --> 00:01:50,080
他们还说蒂娜离开艾克很勇敢
And they say Tina was brave for leaving Ike.

51
00:01:50,660 --> 00:01:52,160
天呐 好疼
Oh, God. That hurts.

52
00:01:52,160 --> 00:01:53,439
天呐 你切到自己了
Oh, my Gosh. You cut yourself.

53
00:01:53,439 --> 00:01:55,394
血可别流到我的蛋里
Don't get blood in my eggs.

54
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:57,960
我们越来越担心
We're getting concerned

55
00:01:57,960 --> 00:02:00,660
莉莉似乎不是很有同情心
that Lily hasn't developed an adequate sense of empathy.

56
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:02,940
应该说是完全没有
Insofar as she doesn't have any at all.

57
00:02:03,660 --> 00:02:05,540
好吧 很好 感觉好像有用
Okay, that's good. I can feel that working.

58
00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:07,140
是啊 终于可以呼吸了
I know. I can finally breathe.

59
00:02:08,380 --> 00:02:10,740
吵得我都无法思考了
I can't hear myself think!

60
00:02:12,620 --> 00:02:14,060
完全可以预见到我们的暮年生活
Nice preview of our sunset years.

61
00:02:14,100 --> 00:02:15,640
她直接把我们的插头[呼吸机]拔掉了
She literally pulled the plug on us.

62
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:18,960
我没打算告诉我爸另一个工作机会的事
I wasn't gonna mention the other job offer to my dad,

63
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:20,940
但我也不想他从别人那里知道
but I didn't want him just hearing about it,

64
00:02:20,940 --> 00:02:24,020
所以在纠结一天后 我决定告诉他
so after wrestling with it all day, I decided to tell him.

65
00:02:24,100 --> 00:02:25,140
你来得真早啊
Hey, you're in early.

66
00:02:25,140 --> 00:02:26,760
你想听个笑话吗
Are you ready to have a laugh?

67
00:02:27,040 --> 00:02:27,680
杰妮斯的发型吗
Janice's haircut?

68
00:02:27,780 --> 00:02:28,840
别太难为她啦
Give her some slack.

69
00:02:28,980 --> 00:02:30,040
她刚刚分手...
She just went through a breakup...

70
00:02:30,040 --> 00:02:32,220
估计是跟个女的 我看她发型猜的
with a woman, I assume, based on the haircut.

71
00:02:32,300 --> 00:02:33,340
不 其实更有意思
No, it's even funnier.

72
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:35,560
你知道我一直在努力争取
Uh, so you know how hard I've been working on

73
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:36,819
皇家大饭店这个客户吧
the Grand Royal Hotel account?

74
00:02:36,819 --> 00:02:39,160
想加薪等明年吧 不过你继续说
Not giving raises till next year, but go on.

75
00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:41,020
他们请我去工作
They offered me a job.

76
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:42,780
很意外 对吧
Crazy, right?

77
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:44,335
-是啊 -是啊
- Yeah. - Yeah.

78
00:02:44,335 --> 00:02:46,040
也不是完全意外
I mean, maybe not "crazy",

79
00:02:46,040 --> 00:02:49,000
但是居然想挖走老板的女儿
but trying to poach the boss's daughter?

80
00:02:49,481 --> 00:02:51,107
我一定是给他们留下了深刻印象
I must have impressed 'em.

81
00:02:51,480 --> 00:02:52,900
你得接受这份工作
You gotta take this offer.

82
00:02:53,420 --> 00:02:53,720
什么
What?

83
00:02:53,720 --> 00:02:55,720
工资更高 福利更好
Higher salary, better benefits.

84
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:57,180
你可能得经常出差
I mean, you might have to travel more,

85
00:02:57,200 --> 00:02:58,340
意味着要时不时离开菲尔
which is time away from Phil.

86
00:02:59,580 --> 00:03:00,360
全是好处
Nothing but upside.

87
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:01,980
他说得对
He was right.

88
00:03:02,620 --> 00:03:04,140
确实是个大好的机会
It was a great opportunity.

89
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:06,260
那个工作机会
I may have been a bit hasty

90
00:03:06,260 --> 00:03:07,920
我可能拒绝得太急了
turning down that job offer so quickly.

91
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:11,260
可以给我一两天时间考虑一下吗
Do you think you could give me a day or two to think about it?

92
00:03:11,500 --> 00:03:13,580
是 这意味着我得离开我爸
Yes, it would mean leaving my dad,

93
00:03:13,580 --> 00:03:14,880
但这是生意场
but this was business.

94
00:03:14,940 --> 00:03:16,240
跟私人感情无关
It wasn't personal.

95
00:03:16,660 --> 00:03:18,860
而且 我爸显然不在乎我的死活
Plus, clearly my father doesn't care if I live or die.

96
00:03:27,260 --> 00:03:30,520
没了智齿 我还有智慧吗
Hey, will I still get wise without my wisdom teeth?

97
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:32,640
-听懂了吗 -都懂啦
- You get it? - Every time.

98
00:03:33,040 --> 00:03:35,255
把止痛片给我吧
Why don't I hold on to the painkillers?

99
00:03:35,255 --> 00:03:36,500
现在我很难过
Now I'm sad.

100
00:03:36,500 --> 00:03:37,220
就在这里
They're right here.

101
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:38,620
你想要时我就给你
I'll give you one when you need one.

102
00:03:38,720 --> 00:03:40,940
不 凯莉说她会在牙医那里等我
No, Kylie said she'd meet me at the dentist

103
00:03:40,940 --> 00:03:42,097
但她没来
and she never came.

104
00:03:42,097 --> 00:03:43,960
我知道 宝贝儿 很遗憾
Ay, I know, Papi, I'm so sorry,

105
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:46,320
我去你卧室里把你的枕头拿来
but I'm gonna get you a very nice pillow from your bedroom.

106
00:03:46,460 --> 00:03:48,980
她想让我这个夏天陪她去戏剧夏令营
She wants me to go away with her to drama camp this summer,

107
00:03:48,980 --> 00:03:51,040
然而她今天都不肯来吗
And then she doesn't even show up today?

108
00:03:51,300 --> 00:03:53,540
也许凯莉改变主意了
Maybe Kylie changed her mind about camp.

109
00:03:53,540 --> 00:03:55,400
也许她想跟很多人交往
Maybe she plans to be with many men

110
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:56,740
她配不上你
and she doesn't deserve you.

111
00:03:57,606 --> 00:03:59,420
曼尼完全看不出来
I hid it very well from Manny,

112
00:03:59,420 --> 00:04:00,720
但我真的很讨厌那姑娘
but I hated that girl.

113
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:02,940
她和曼尼发展得太快太认真了
She was getting too serious too fast.

114
00:04:04,320 --> 00:04:06,040
我好抱歉
I'm so sorry.

115
00:04:06,160 --> 00:04:07,440
我的排球训练延时了
My volleyball practice went long

116
00:04:07,440 --> 00:04:08,720
然后我的手机没电了
and then my phone died.

117
00:04:09,060 --> 00:04:11,760
我想吻你 但我嘴里一股药味
I want to kiss you, but I have surgery breath.

118
00:04:12,920 --> 00:04:14,140
你要快点回到可以亲吻的状态
Just make sure you're back in kissing shape

119
00:04:14,140 --> 00:04:15,640
我们一起参加夏令营时就能亲亲了
in time for us to go to camp together.

120
00:04:15,640 --> 00:04:17,300
我为什么一直闻到草莓的味道
Why do I keep smelling strawberries?

121
00:04:17,356 --> 00:04:18,759
他们对我做了什么
What did they do to me?

122
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:21,380
是我给你带来的奶昔啦
It's the milkshake I brought you.

123
00:04:21,380 --> 00:04:22,740
瞧瞧
Oh, and look.

124
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:25,740
我一般都等你没注意的时候才偷看
I usually wait till you're not looking, then I look.

125
00:04:25,980 --> 00:04:28,340
是说你送人家的围巾 讨厌了啦
The scarf you gave me, you dog!

126
00:04:28,900 --> 00:04:30,682
实际上 现在是观看的好时机
Actually, now's a good time to look

127
00:04:30,682 --> 00:04:32,128
因为我看到了四个
'cause I kinda see four of them.

128
00:04:32,340 --> 00:04:34,960
我吃了几片药
I got a couple pills in me.

129
00:04:36,060 --> 00:04:39,480
逃课日 逃课日 逃课日
Ditch Day. Ditch Day. Ditch Day.

130
00:04:39,580 --> 00:04:40,240
逃课...
Ditch...

131
00:04:41,480 --> 00:04:42,140
15分钟
15 minutes.

132
00:04:42,140 --> 00:04:43,740
连加油的时候你们都没停
When you didn't stop while we were getting gas,

133
00:04:43,780 --> 00:04:44,920
我还以为你们会一直喊下去呢
I thought it might just go on forever.

134
00:04:45,640 --> 00:04:47,280
天啊
Sweet Myrna Loy!

135
00:04:52,700 --> 00:04:53,280
爸爸 你知道放的不是
Dad, you know it's not

136
00:04:53,280 --> 00:04:54,920
一部名叫《拆迁公告》的电影 对吧
a movie called "Demolition Notice", right?

137
00:04:55,200 --> 00:04:57,240
我靠自己的双手建造了这个影院...
I built this theater with these two hands...

138
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:59,400
还有其余14个人的28只手
plus the 28 hands of 14 other guys.

139
00:05:00,520 --> 00:05:01,760
就你 建造的
You...built this.

140
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:02,800
我整修的
Renovated it.

141
00:05:02,960 --> 00:05:04,840
进入房地产界之前我在建筑业工作
Before I got into real estate, I worked construction.

142
00:05:04,840 --> 00:05:06,406
就你 在建筑业工作
You....worked construction.

143
00:05:06,406 --> 00:05:07,883
是的 别那样说话
Yeah, stop staying it like that.

144
00:05:08,440 --> 00:05:10,580
我为这地方消耗了10个月心血
I put 10 months of my life into this place.

145
00:05:11,200 --> 00:05:12,640
我很想在他们拆掉这栋建筑前
I'd love to look around one last time

146
00:05:12,640 --> 00:05:14,000
最后看看这里
before they tear the old girl down.

147
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:15,198
变老真糟糕
Oh, well, sucks to be getting old.

148
00:05:15,198 --> 00:05:16,997
我们要闯进去
You know what? We're bustin' in.

149
00:05:17,316 --> 00:05:19,491
怎么做啊 用砖头砸窗户吗
How? Smash a window with a brick?

150
00:05:20,100 --> 00:05:22,820
我想到了更为优雅的办法
I had something a little more elegant in mind.

151
00:05:22,880 --> 00:05:27,300
我想你们忘记了 是我建造了这栋大楼
I think you forget that I gave birth to this building.

152
00:05:28,380 --> 00:05:29,840
我知道她的长处
I know her strengths...

153
00:05:29,840 --> 00:05:32,180
和弱点
and... her weaknesses.

154
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:38,120
你们有看到砖头吗
Did you see a brick?

155
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:42,600
我走进老爸的办公室
So I walked into to Dad's office,

156
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:44,900
他拿着我的照片
and he is holding a picture of me,

157
00:05:44,900 --> 00:05:47,800
满眼含泪地看着
looking at it with tears welling in his eyes.

158
00:05:48,340 --> 00:05:50,480
我们小时候老爸从来没有这么多愁善感
Oh, Dad was never that emotional when we were growing up.

159
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:52,940
就是啊 所以这事才这么难办
I know. That's what makes this whole thing so hard!

160
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:54,740
也许莉莉没学到同情
Maybe lily hasn't learned empathy

161
00:05:54,740 --> 00:05:57,000
是因为没看见我表现出同情心
because she hasn't seen it from me, you know?

162
00:05:57,200 --> 00:05:59,340
我们能在上面包之前先专注于我的问题吗
Could we maybe stay on my problem until the bread comes?

163
00:05:59,500 --> 00:06:01,160
对不起 听起来你好像是说完了
I'm sorry. It sounded like you were done. Sorry.

164
00:06:01,400 --> 00:06:04,080
我跟酒店那边说的是
So, the way I left things with the hotel company

165
00:06:04,080 --> 00:06:06,000
我还需要一点时间来考虑
is that I need a little more time to decide,

166
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:07,964
但是说真的 我打算拒绝他们
but honestly, I think I'm gonna tell 'em no.

167
00:06:08,055 --> 00:06:10,020
看见那一幕之后我怎么能离开老爸
I mean, how could I leave Dad after what I saw?

168
00:06:10,020 --> 00:06:12,020
真是令人心碎
It's just -- it's heartbreaking.

169
00:06:12,320 --> 00:06:13,740
我都快哭了
Oh, I could cry.

170
00:06:13,740 --> 00:06:14,640
谢谢
Thank you.

171
00:06:14,880 --> 00:06:16,200
也许如果莉莉看见我哭
Maybe if Lily saw me cry,

172
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:18,120
她就会觉得哭也没关系
she would see that it's okay to be that way,

173
00:06:18,120 --> 00:06:20,380
特别是看见我这个从来不哭的坚忍老爸哭
especially coming from me, her stoic dad who never cries.

174
00:06:21,340 --> 00:06:22,880
拜托 你刚才肯定说完了啊
Oh, come on, you had to be done that time.

175
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:25,540
知道吗 你说得对 说你的事吧
You know what? You're right. Let's do you.

176
00:06:25,700 --> 00:06:27,140
反正你的问题比我的更大
Your problem is bigger than mine anyway,

177
00:06:27,840 --> 00:06:30,580
因为如果你的计划是在莉莉面前哭
'cause if your plan is to cry in front of Lily...

178
00:06:31,020 --> 00:06:31,920
算了吧
Forget it.

179
00:06:31,960 --> 00:06:33,138
你情感上太冷漠了
You're too emotionally constipated.

180
00:06:33,138 --> 00:06:34,982
我知道你在开玩笑 克莱尔
You know, I-I know you're joking, Claire,

181
00:06:34,982 --> 00:06:38,040
但是有时候言语会伤人
but sometimes... sometimes words hurt, you know?

182
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:39,520
一想起我的亲姐姐...
And to think that my own sister...

183
00:06:39,520 --> 00:06:42,580
我的亲姐姐会说我 算了吧
my own sister would accuse me of -- Oh, screw it.

184
00:06:42,580 --> 00:06:45,100
我就看一部悲剧电影来催泪吧 没关系
I'll just work up some tears with a sad movie. It's fine.

185
00:06:48,760 --> 00:06:49,320
妈妈
Mom?

186
00:06:50,880 --> 00:06:52,360
你醒了啊
You're awake.

187
00:06:52,580 --> 00:06:53,720
你感觉怎么样
How you feeling?

188
00:06:55,140 --> 00:06:56,380
你给我买了个气球
You bought me a balloon.

189
00:06:56,920 --> 00:06:58,438
-什么 -还有泰迪熊
- What? - And a teddy bear.

190
00:06:58,438 --> 00:07:00,086
你什么时候买的
When did you buy all this stuff?

191
00:07:00,904 --> 00:07:02,914
你睡觉的时候
When -- when you were asleep

192
00:07:03,080 --> 00:07:05,320
我还给你买了草莓奶昔
and I got you a strawberry milkshake.

193
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:07,780
世上只有妈妈好
Mom, you're the best.

194
00:07:08,420 --> 00:07:09,940
他什么都不记得了
He couldn't remember a thing.

195
00:07:09,940 --> 00:07:13,880
我只要拖住他到五点报名截止
All I had to do was to get him past the 5:00 deadline

196
00:07:13,880 --> 00:07:15,940
这样他就没法和凯莉一起出行了
so that he couldn't go on that trip with Kylie.

197
00:07:16,500 --> 00:07:18,080
我知道在夏令营会发生什么
I know what happens at camp.

198
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:19,260
我看过《疯狂夏令营》
I've seen "Meatballs".

199
00:07:20,280 --> 00:07:22,260
我还是难以相信凯莉放了我鸽子
I still can't believe Kylie flaked on me.

200
00:07:22,400 --> 00:07:23,660
我还以为她真的很喜欢我
I thought she really liked me.

201
00:07:23,780 --> 00:07:24,860
我想不是吧
I guess not.

202
00:07:25,140 --> 00:07:26,640
又该吃药了 宝贝
Time for more pills, baby.

203
00:07:26,640 --> 00:07:28,740
真的吗 我已经很晕了
Really? I'm already so loopy.

204
00:07:28,740 --> 00:07:30,600
得在感觉到疼之前就吃
We have to get ahead of the pain.

205
00:07:31,580 --> 00:07:32,700
也许她给我发了短信
Maybe she texted me.

206
00:07:33,020 --> 00:07:33,920
你看见我的手机了吗
Have you seen my phone?

207
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:36,460
不是在那里吗
Is it over there?

208
00:07:38,100 --> 00:07:39,900
我没看见
I don't see it.

209
00:07:41,260 --> 00:07:41,999
你在干什么
What are you doing?

210
00:07:41,999 --> 00:07:44,100
拥抱你
Eh...hugging!

211
00:07:44,100 --> 00:07:45,180
你真贴心
You're so sweet.

212
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:47,600
但我觉得这些药没效果
But I don't think these pills are really doing anything.

213
00:07:50,580 --> 00:07:52,240
这地方看起来眼熟吗
Does this place look familiar?

214
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:55,040
是的 我们就是在这里被谋杀的
Oh, yeah. This is where we were all murdered.

215
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:58,240
不 你们姐妹就是在这看的第一部电影
No, silly. This is where you girls saw your first movie.

216
00:07:58,468 --> 00:08:00,340
《兔八哥之夜》放了一半时
Halfway through "Hare-Abian Nights",

217
00:08:00,340 --> 00:08:02,300
我往旁边看去 你们的小脑袋挤在一起
I looked over, and your little heads were pressed together

218
00:08:02,300 --> 00:08:03,820
像是可爱的小圆锥帐篷
like the cutest teepee ever.

219
00:08:04,660 --> 00:08:07,280
全家人找乐子时我在哪里
And where was I during all of this family fun?

220
00:08:07,380 --> 00:08:09,620
小子 我们仨当时在过女生之日呢
Buddy, the three of us were having a girls' day.

221
00:08:09,620 --> 00:08:10,660
你懂的
You get it.

222
00:08:11,020 --> 00:08:12,860
这边 屏幕这里
This way. Over here by the screen.

223
00:08:15,380 --> 00:08:15,900
话说
So...

224
00:08:15,900 --> 00:08:18,860
我还在建造这里时
while I was still building this place,

225
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:24,320
有天下班后 我和你们一起偷偷溜回来
I snuck back here with you guys after work one day, and...

226
00:08:24,320 --> 00:08:24,900
瞧瞧看
check it out.

227
00:08:25,203 --> 00:08:28,240
爸爸 那是我们的脚印吗
Aw, dad! Are those our feet?

228
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:29,360
瞧瞧有多小
Look at how tiny!

229
00:08:29,840 --> 00:08:30,800
我的脚印呢
Where's my footprints?

230
00:08:31,600 --> 00:08:33,640
我猜这个是你的
Um... I guess that's you. Anyway...

231
00:08:33,640 --> 00:08:34,760
那看起来像个婴儿的脑袋印
That looks like a baby head.

232
00:08:34,860 --> 00:08:35,883
这俩丫头我都忙不过来
I was struggling with these two.

233
00:08:35,883 --> 00:08:36,640
加上你一直扭个不停
You were all squirmy.

234
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:38,080
我都道过很多次歉了
I'm not gonna apologize over and over.

235
00:08:38,460 --> 00:08:39,420
来吧 我们拿上这个
Come on, let's grab this thing.

236
00:08:39,520 --> 00:08:40,660
拿什么 水泥吗
Grab what, the cement?

237
00:08:40,780 --> 00:08:42,680
这地方过几天就要变成一片废墟了
This place is gonna be rubble in a few days.

238
00:08:42,680 --> 00:08:43,548
我想要留点回忆
I want a memento.

239
00:08:43,548 --> 00:08:44,660
行动吧
Let's do it!

240
00:08:44,660 --> 00:08:46,940
这个看起来比较像男孩子的工作
All right, well, this seems more like boys' work,

241
00:08:46,940 --> 00:08:50,000
你们慢慢玩哦
so you guys take your time on that, okay?

242
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:51,340
真是超棒的探险
Super fun adventure!

243
00:08:52,560 --> 00:08:54,280
他们至少要花一个小时
Okay, so that's at least an hour.

244
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:55,540
马路对面有家商场
There's a mall across the street.

245
00:08:55,580 --> 00:08:56,860
我打电话叫车 现在去学校
I'm calling a car and going to school.

246
00:08:57,180 --> 00:08:58,920
加州理工要我尽快选好室友
Caltech needs my roommate selection by --

247
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:00,880
你到底怎么了
What's your problem?

248
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:03,240
你怎么了 你不跟老爸说一声就要走吗
What's yours? You're just gonna leave without telling Dad?

249
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:05,000
你不是还要带我去商场吗
You were just about to take me to a mall.

250
00:09:05,180 --> 00:09:06,640
好吧 你看不出区别就算了
Okay, if you can't see the difference...

251
00:09:07,140 --> 00:09:09,280
抱歉 比起逛街或者坐在一间
Look, I'm sorry I've got better things to do

252
00:09:09,280 --> 00:09:11,580
我们过去看动画片的破影院里
than go shop or sit in some creepy old movie theater

253
00:09:11,580 --> 00:09:12,640
我还有更重要的事情做
Where we used to watch cartoons.

254
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:14,680
我知道 你比我们都厉害多了
I get it. You're beyond all of us now.

255
00:09:14,780 --> 00:09:16,880
快去挑你的书呆子学院小伙伴吧
Go pick out your playmates at nerd academy.

256
00:09:18,040 --> 00:09:18,480
好吧
Fine.

257
00:09:18,700 --> 00:09:20,860
我就在这里挑室友好了
I'll just pick out my roommate here then.

258
00:09:21,040 --> 00:09:22,960
抱歉我对上大学的事太激动了
Sorry I'm so excited about college.

259
00:09:23,420 --> 00:09:24,720
我不接受道歉
Apology not accepted.

260
00:09:24,900 --> 00:09:27,040
反正我也没想真道歉
I wasn't actually apologizing, so...

261
00:09:27,040 --> 00:09:28,120
找到灯了
Found the light!

262
00:09:28,860 --> 00:09:29,660
找到凿子了
Found the chisel!

263
00:09:31,800 --> 00:09:32,500
找到扫把了
Found the broom.

264
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:37,160
不 不
No, no.

265
00:09:37,640 --> 00:09:39,160
米奇尔 出什么事了
Mitchell? What's wrong?

266
00:09:39,500 --> 00:09:41,700
我觉得莉莉对人这么冷漠
I feel like Lily's inability to show feelings

267
00:09:41,700 --> 00:09:43,200
可能是我的错
for other people might be my fault.

268
00:09:43,340 --> 00:09:44,000
亲爱的
Oh, honey.

269
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:46,200
我也这么觉得 不过至少
I think that, too, but just take comfort in knowing

270
00:09:46,200 --> 00:09:47,360
你自己意识到了
you got there on your own.

271
00:09:47,540 --> 00:09:49,300
我在看《廊桥遗梦》
I'm watching "The Bridges of Madison County"

272
00:09:49,300 --> 00:09:51,140
因为这是唯一能弄哭我的
because it's the only thing that makes me cry.

273
00:09:51,820 --> 00:09:52,828
等她回家了
When she gets home,

274
00:09:52,828 --> 00:09:55,689
我会关掉电视假装我在读这个
I'm going to turn this off and pretend I was reading this.

275
00:09:55,920 --> 00:09:57,400
《台风荡平孤儿院》
"Typhoon Flattens Orphanage"?

276
00:09:57,460 --> 00:09:58,900
很悲伤的故事吧
Yeah, that's sad, right?

277
00:09:59,132 --> 00:10:00,004
现在 你快走
Now -- now get out of here,

278
00:10:00,004 --> 00:10:01,340
她随时可能回来
because she's going to be home any second,

279
00:10:01,340 --> 00:10:02,500
我得努力维持悲伤的状态
and I'm trying to stay sad.

280
00:10:02,760 --> 00:10:04,280
等等 等等 我想问清楚
Wait. Wait, wait, wait, wait. Just to clarify,

281
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:05,600
唯一能弄哭你的
the only thing that makes you cry...

282
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:08,560
能真正在情感上让你产生共鸣的
that truly resonates with you on a deep, emotional level

283
00:10:08,560 --> 00:10:13,900
是一部关于陷入无爱婚姻之苦的电影吗
is a film about someone... who's trapped in a loveless marriage?

284
00:10:14,020 --> 00:10:15,060
好了 小卡 请快走
Okay, Cam, please go.

285
00:10:15,080 --> 00:10:16,320
我已经开始出戏了
I'm starting not to feel anything.

286
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:18,360
你知道那有多伤人吗
Do you know how hurtful that is?

287
00:10:18,400 --> 00:10:19,260
我回来了
I'm home!

288
00:10:19,420 --> 00:10:21,060
我现在哭不下去了 真棒
And now I'm not crying. Great.

289
00:10:21,880 --> 00:10:23,760
亲爱的 你今天过得怎么样
Hey, sweetie. Hi. How was your day?

290
00:10:23,920 --> 00:10:25,880
比她过得好 发生什么事了
Better than hers. What's wrong now?

291
00:10:26,020 --> 00:10:27,300
大爸有点小情绪
Daddy's just having a moment.

292
00:10:27,300 --> 00:10:29,600
他总是有小情绪
He's always having a moment.

293
00:10:29,887 --> 00:10:32,620
等等 天呐 我刚发现一件事
Oh, wait. Oh, my gosh. I-I just realized something.

294
00:10:32,620 --> 00:10:33,677
怎么 你发现我们的婚床
What, that our marriage bed

295
00:10:33,677 --> 00:10:35,580
是个1200针的无爱摆设吗
is a 1,200 thread-count charade?

296
00:10:35,580 --> 00:10:36,920
不 这可能不是我的错
No, maybe this isn't my fault.

297
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:39,760
也许莉莉没有同情心是因为你老是哭
Maybe Lily can't show empathy because you're always crying.

298
00:10:39,840 --> 00:10:41,181
-所以怪我咯 -对
- Oh, so it's my fault? - Yes.

299
00:10:41,181 --> 00:10:43,580
你害她对正常的情感麻木了
You've totally desensitized her to normal emotions.

300
00:10:43,580 --> 00:10:44,259
才没有
That's not true!

301
00:10:44,259 --> 00:10:46,540
而且你现在很想哭
And now you wanna cry,

302
00:10:46,540 --> 00:10:50,200
因为她因为你总是哭而从来不哭
because she won't cry because you're always crying.

303
00:10:50,320 --> 00:10:51,680
然而你会知道这个
And you would only know that

304
00:10:51,680 --> 00:10:53,340
是因为你真爱我
because you do love me!

305
00:10:57,700 --> 00:10:58,680
亲爱的 怎么了
Hi, honey. What's up?

306
00:10:58,940 --> 00:11:00,340
我只是想告诉你
Well, I just wanted to let you know

307
00:11:00,340 --> 00:11:02,320
我拒绝了酒店的职位
I turned down that hotel job offer.

308
00:11:02,460 --> 00:11:03,080
为什么
How come?

309
00:11:03,500 --> 00:11:05,221
生活中有比钱更重要的东西
Some things are just more important than money,

310
00:11:05,221 --> 00:11:06,381
对我来说那包括我的家...
and for me that includes my fam--

311
00:11:06,381 --> 00:11:07,725
真疼
Man, that smarts.

312
00:11:08,520 --> 00:11:09,480
你在干什么
What are you doing?

313
00:11:09,680 --> 00:11:10,600
修修鼻毛
Just trimming the hedges.

314
00:11:10,700 --> 00:11:12,599
我之前见到一张自己的仰角照
I saw a low-angle photo of me the other day.

315
00:11:12,599 --> 00:11:14,356
看起来就像我鼻子里有个犹太传教士[大胡子]
I looked like a snorted a rabbi.

316
00:11:14,769 --> 00:11:16,040
你 你拿着我的照片
And -- and -- and you're using

317
00:11:16,040 --> 00:11:18,520
当你的镜子吗
a picture of me as your mirror?

318
00:11:18,760 --> 00:11:20,440
真的是你诶
Oh, it is you!

319
00:11:28,820 --> 00:11:30,440
那不是我的手机吗
Hey, is that my phone?

320
00:11:30,720 --> 00:11:31,420
是的
Ah, yes!

321
00:11:31,420 --> 00:11:33,220
我在你睡觉的时候找到的
I found it while you were asleep.

322
00:11:33,440 --> 00:11:35,740
我先放回你的卧室 等你醒了再说吧
Um, let me put it back in your bedroom until you wake up.

323
00:11:35,900 --> 00:11:37,580
凯莉给我发短信了
Oh, Kylie texted me.

324
00:11:37,660 --> 00:11:39,400
她发来一张我和她的照片
She sent me a photo of me and her.

325
00:11:39,400 --> 00:11:40,940
就坐在这
Sitting right here.

326
00:11:40,940 --> 00:11:42,620
也许她是溜进来的
Oh, maybe she sneak in

327
00:11:42,620 --> 00:11:45,480
在我去给你买那些东西的时候
while I was getting you all those nice stuff.

328
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:46,740
但你就在我们身后
But you're behind me,

329
00:11:46,740 --> 00:11:48,980
用一种可怕的眼神盯着我们
staring at us with a terrible look on your face.

330
00:11:49,400 --> 00:11:51,660
不可能 我照相都很注意
Oh, that's impossible. I never take a bad picture.

331
00:11:51,900 --> 00:11:54,320
你是想破坏我和凯莉的关系吗
Are you trying to sabotage my relationship with Kylie?

332
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:59,205
她的衣服太紧身 她的鞋跟太高
Her clothes are too tight, her heels are too high,

333
00:11:59,205 --> 00:12:00,260
她嗓门又大 而且
She's so loud, and --

334
00:12:00,260 --> 00:12:02,620
而且我讨厌她管得你密不透风
And I hate how she smothers you!

335
00:12:02,740 --> 00:12:05,400
天呐 你在说自己吗
Oh, my God. You're describing yourself.

336
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:07,500
不 我的衣服不算...
No! My clothes are not that...

337
00:12:07,980 --> 00:12:09,320
我的鞋跟...
My heels are...

338
00:12:09,920 --> 00:12:11,760
我也没那么吵
I am not... loud.

339
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:13,860
我在跟我妈约会
I'm dating my mother!

340
00:12:15,400 --> 00:12:16,320
真恶心
Oh, gross.

341
00:12:16,540 --> 00:12:17,200
你说什么
Excuse me?

342
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:20,180
我以前喜欢她 可现在都变了
I used to like her, but now it's ruined.

343
00:12:20,440 --> 00:12:23,520
得了吧 还有比约会自己老妈更糟的呢
Please. There are worse things than dating your own mother.

344
00:12:23,740 --> 00:12:24,420
比如说呢
Like what?

345
00:12:24,540 --> 00:12:26,000
我不喜欢你这种态度
You know what? I don't like this attitude,

346
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:27,920
我相信凯莉也不会喜欢的
and I am sure that Kylie won't like it either.

347
00:12:28,100 --> 00:12:30,200
也许你的确需要一个她那样的人
Maybe you do need somebody like her

348
00:12:30,200 --> 00:12:32,680
当我不在的时候管着你
to keep you in line while I am not around.

349
00:12:32,960 --> 00:12:33,760
你在干什么
What are you doing?

350
00:12:33,880 --> 00:12:35,880
我要把你的申请发给戏剧夏令营
I am sending your application to drama camp.

351
00:12:35,920 --> 00:12:36,780
我们还有两分钟
We still have two minutes.

352
00:12:36,920 --> 00:12:37,900
老妈 你休想
Mom, don't you dare.

353
00:12:39,940 --> 00:12:41,800
名字 年龄...
Okay, name, age...

354
00:12:41,900 --> 00:12:44,080
街道名[绰号] 黑帮里的那种外号吗
street name? Like you're in a gang?

355
00:12:44,100 --> 00:12:45,700
我不想跟凯莉一起去夏令营了
I don't want to go to camp with Kylie now!

356
00:12:45,800 --> 00:12:46,700
太恶心了
It's disgusting!

357
00:12:46,795 --> 00:12:49,386
她又发短信来了
Oh, look. We got another text from Ky--

358
00:12:49,801 --> 00:12:52,189
是一张她穿比基尼的照片
she send a picture of her in a bikini!

359
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:52,800
真的吗
She did?

360
00:12:53,188 --> 00:12:54,840
那你还是把申请发过去吧
You -- you can just go ahead and hit "send".

361
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:57,560
别想了 你不能跟这种女孩去夏令营的
No. You're not going to go to camp with a girl like that.

362
00:12:57,640 --> 00:12:59,900
我的天 老妈 你疯了
Oh, my God. Mom, you're crazy!

363
00:13:00,380 --> 00:13:01,920
一会儿同意一会儿不同意
Yes. No. Yes. No.

364
00:13:02,060 --> 00:13:03,880
你讨厌每一个和我约会的女孩
You hate every single girl I like.

365
00:13:04,220 --> 00:13:05,980
你必须得让我自己做决定
You have to start letting me make my own decisions,

366
00:13:05,980 --> 00:13:08,620
否则大家笑我的话都要成真了
or everything everybody says about me is true--

367
00:13:08,780 --> 00:13:10,260
我就是个妈宝
I'm a giant mama's boy.

368
00:13:10,740 --> 00:13:12,160
他们真的这么叫你吗
Do they really call you that?

369
00:13:12,500 --> 00:13:14,240
没错 难道这就是你想看到的吗
Yes. Now is that what you want?

370
00:13:16,040 --> 00:13:16,900
好吧
Okay, fine.

371
00:13:17,480 --> 00:13:19,040
你想去的话 去吧
If you want to go, go.

372
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:22,080
谢谢
Thank you.

373
00:13:24,540 --> 00:13:26,020
我也有那套比基尼
I have that same bikini.

374
00:13:30,572 --> 00:13:32,060
我们需要一个撬杠或是什么
Okay, we're gonna need a crow bar

375
00:13:32,060 --> 00:13:33,340
来把它弄起来
or something to lift this thing.

376
00:13:33,380 --> 00:13:35,540
你在后面找找 我去架子上翻一翻
You look back there, and I'll check these shelves.

377
00:13:38,980 --> 00:13:39,860
有能用的吗
Anything up there?

378
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:41,460
什么都没有
Not a thing, buddy.

379
00:13:43,020 --> 00:13:44,680
我好像看见了某种...
I feel like I saw some sort of a--

380
00:13:44,680 --> 00:13:45,540
他们知道吗
Are they aware...?

381
00:13:45,820 --> 00:13:46,500
怎么可能知道
Not a chance.

382
00:13:46,500 --> 00:13:48,500
也许可以用这个扫帚把它弄松
Maybe we can use this broom handle to pry it loose.

383
00:13:48,620 --> 00:13:50,840
不行 弄不开的
No, that won't work. Oh, no.

384
00:13:52,320 --> 00:13:52,880
可以弄开
Yes, it will.

385
00:13:54,880 --> 00:13:55,760
来吧
Come on!

386
00:13:58,240 --> 00:13:59,300
好险
That was close.

387
00:14:04,280 --> 00:14:06,280
很抱歉之前对你那么刻薄
Sorry I was a jerk earlier.

388
00:14:07,820 --> 00:14:09,240
又能和你一起看动画片
I'm actually having a lot of fun

389
00:14:09,240 --> 00:14:10,500
我其实很开心
watching cartoons with you again.

390
00:14:10,581 --> 00:14:12,640
是我的错 我就是有一点...
It was my fault. I'm just a little...

391
00:14:15,069 --> 00:14:16,595
你以后会打电话给我吗
Are you ever gonna call me?

392
00:14:17,620 --> 00:14:17,980
什么
What?

393
00:14:18,734 --> 00:14:19,940
我一直
It's just something I've--

394
00:14:19,940 --> 00:14:21,720
我一直在想
I've been wondering about, you know.

395
00:14:21,780 --> 00:14:23,460
我们现在住在一起
Like, we live together,

396
00:14:23,460 --> 00:14:24,640
所以你不用打电话给我
so you don't have to call me,

397
00:14:24,740 --> 00:14:26,500
可是一旦你去了那所高智商学校
and once you're off at brainy school,

398
00:14:26,500 --> 00:14:28,520
身边全是高智商的同学
surrounded by a bunch of brainy brains...

399
00:14:28,757 --> 00:14:31,020
我们还会是朋友吗
are we gonna be friends?

400
00:14:31,020 --> 00:14:33,020
你在说什么 你可是我姐姐
What are you talking about? You're my sister.

401
00:14:33,360 --> 00:14:35,290
对啊 我们是姐妹
Oh, right. Yeah, sisters.

402
00:14:35,290 --> 00:14:38,720
每个节假日我们都要看见对方 感恩节
Like, we're obligated to see each other on Thanksgiving,

403
00:14:38,720 --> 00:14:39,560
圣诞节...
Christmas...

404
00:14:40,380 --> 00:14:42,300
-卢克的葬礼 -我没事
- Luke's funeral. - I'm fine!

405
00:14:46,823 --> 00:14:47,819
怎么了
"Uh-oh" what?

406
00:14:48,760 --> 00:14:49,200
没事
Nothing.

407
00:14:49,380 --> 00:14:50,100
你干了什么
What did you do?

408
00:14:50,420 --> 00:14:51,900
我是听从你的指令
I was following your orders.

409
00:14:52,140 --> 00:14:53,840
我很惊讶你居然没让我站在中间
I'm surprised you didn't ask me to stand on top

410
00:14:53,840 --> 00:14:55,340
然后用锯子在我周围锯一个圈
and saw around myself in a circle.

411
00:14:55,580 --> 00:14:57,140
我们要这个东西有什么用
Why do we even need this stupid thing?

412
00:14:57,240 --> 00:14:59,457
因为他们要拆除我唯一建造过的东西
Because they're tearing down the only thing I've ever built.

413
00:14:59,457 --> 00:15:01,420
站在那别动 我们能行
Just stand there. We can still do is.

414
00:15:01,420 --> 00:15:03,420
当一名房地产中介挺好的
Yeah, it's great being a real estate agent,

415
00:15:03,520 --> 00:15:05,320
我的脸被印在广告牌和笔上
my face is on billboards and pens.

416
00:15:05,380 --> 00:15:06,580
我还有预算布置气球
I have a balloon budget.

417
00:15:06,640 --> 00:15:07,860
但是那些都没办法永存
But none of it ever lasts.

418
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:08,860
一旦这地方被拆了
Once this place is gone,

419
00:15:08,960 --> 00:15:10,320
就再也没有什么能让我指着说
they're won't be anything I can point to and say,

420
00:15:10,440 --> 00:15:11,040
"这都归功于我"
"I made that."

421
00:15:13,680 --> 00:15:15,776
-你干了什么 -你觉得呢
- What did you do? - What does it look like?!

422
00:15:15,776 --> 00:15:17,549
我把水管弄坏了
I sprung a leak!

423
00:15:20,821 --> 00:15:23,296
一定有阀门能关掉它的
There's gotta be a water shut-off!

424
00:15:26,520 --> 00:15:26,980
海莉...
Haley...

425
00:15:26,980 --> 00:15:28,841
如果我最近表现出来
I'm sorry if I've been acting like

426
00:15:28,841 --> 00:15:30,704
不想跟你出去玩的样子 我很抱歉
I didn't wanna hang out with you lately.

427
00:15:32,080 --> 00:15:33,000
我可能一直都这么表现
Or...ever.

428
00:15:33,840 --> 00:15:35,280
别担心了
Don't worry about it.

429
00:15:36,180 --> 00:15:37,120
我从没担心过
I'm not worried.

430
00:15:37,640 --> 00:15:39,140
等我们不被关在一起
We'll probably be even closer

431
00:15:39,140 --> 00:15:41,260
我们俩可能会更亲密
once we're not actually caged in together.

432
00:15:41,400 --> 00:15:42,660
我会总打电话给你的
I'll be calling you all the time.

433
00:15:43,700 --> 00:15:44,380
想想看
Think about it--

434
00:15:44,380 --> 00:15:46,500
整个校园里都是艾丽克斯
I'm about to live on a campus full of Alexes.

435
00:15:47,840 --> 00:15:49,180
一定会很让人抓狂的
That's bound to get annoying.

436
00:15:49,320 --> 00:15:53,440
到时候除了你还能有谁帮我应付艾丽克斯
And when it does, who better to deal with an Alex than you?

437
00:16:00,060 --> 00:16:01,160
这都归功于我
I made that.

438
00:16:02,720 --> 00:16:03,900
你想见我
Hey, you wanted to see me?

439
00:16:04,040 --> 00:16:05,980
-刚跟丹·希格诺打完电话 -谁
- Just got off the phone with Dan Signer. - Who?

440
00:16:06,400 --> 00:16:08,920
他是皇家大酒店的大股东之一
He's one of the big mucks at the Grand Royal Hotels.

441
00:16:09,600 --> 00:16:11,040
他们打算取消和我们的合作
They're thinking about dropping our account.

442
00:16:11,620 --> 00:16:13,660
因为你拒绝了他们
Something about you turning down the job offer.

443
00:16:13,660 --> 00:16:15,647
然后又接受
Well... and then accepting it,

444
00:16:15,980 --> 00:16:18,760
然后又拒绝 接着又接受
and then turning it down, and then accepting it again.

445
00:16:19,140 --> 00:16:20,680
你为什么要这样耍他
Why are you jerking him around?

446
00:16:20,860 --> 00:16:21,820
你比克劳迪娅还糟糕
You're worse than Claudia.

447
00:16:21,889 --> 00:16:24,680
-谁是克劳迪娅 -杰妮斯的前女友
- Who's claudia? - Janice's ex-girlfriend.

448
00:16:24,680 --> 00:16:26,400
她把她骗了整整八年
She strung her along for eight years,

449
00:16:26,540 --> 00:16:28,660
她们现在在为两只拉布拉多的监护权打官司
now they're in a custody battle over two Labradors.

450
00:16:28,660 --> 00:16:31,020
难道今天我是唯一一个在休息室
Am I the only one that got stuck in the break room

451
00:16:31,020 --> 00:16:31,600
听她诉苦的人吗
with her today?

452
00:16:31,840 --> 00:16:32,820
老爸 如果能行
Okay, dad, look. If it'll help,

453
00:16:32,920 --> 00:16:34,460
我会打给酒店的人 把这一切都说开
I'll call the hotel people and I'll straighten all this out.

454
00:16:34,460 --> 00:16:37,020
我不觉得你再打电话去有什么用
I don't think more calls from you is the answer,

455
00:16:37,380 --> 00:16:38,080
还有
and by the way,

456
00:16:38,220 --> 00:16:39,748
我觉得你拿不到那份工作了
I don't think you're gonna get that job anymore.

457
00:16:39,748 --> 00:16:42,260
行啊 我无所谓 我才不在乎呢
Fine! I don't care! I don't care!

458
00:16:42,260 --> 00:16:43,820
我从一开始就没想要那份工作
I never wanted that job in the first place!

459
00:16:43,920 --> 00:16:46,280
那你为什么一开始要跟我说呢
Well, then why did you tell me about it in the first place?

460
00:16:46,320 --> 00:16:48,500
因为我想让你叫我别去做那份工作啊
Because I wanted you to tell me not to take the job

461
00:16:48,500 --> 00:16:49,660
因为我是你女儿
Because I'm your daughter!

462
00:16:49,840 --> 00:16:51,580
那面镜子后面的那个人
You know, the thing behind the mirror

463
00:16:51,580 --> 00:16:53,940
就是你用来修鼻毛的那面镜子
that you...trim your nose hairs with?

464
00:16:55,580 --> 00:16:57,280
你有在意过我的去留吗
Don't you even care if I stay or go?

465
00:16:57,280 --> 00:16:58,720
我当然有
Of course I do.

466
00:16:59,100 --> 00:17:00,600
好吧 可你没什么表示啊
Well, you don't show it.

467
00:17:00,840 --> 00:17:02,940
也许是因为我不想让这影响到你的决定
Well, maybe because I didn't want that to be a factor.

468
00:17:03,680 --> 00:17:05,760
一想到我的感受可能让你做不了
It would kill me if I thought that what I felt

469
00:17:05,760 --> 00:17:07,700
你想做的事 我就会痛苦到不行
would hold you back from getting something that you wanted.

470
00:17:07,980 --> 00:17:10,460
你要相信 当我看到那份工作邀请
But trust me, when I saw that job offer,

471
00:17:10,500 --> 00:17:11,960
我紧张得心都快要跳出来
my heart almost fell out of my chest.

472
00:17:12,400 --> 00:17:14,060
我很爱我们一起工作
I love us working together!

473
00:17:14,980 --> 00:17:17,480
谢谢 那好吧
Thanks. Okay, then.

474
00:17:18,180 --> 00:17:19,060
那好吧
"Okay, then"?

475
00:17:19,060 --> 00:17:21,280
我掏心掏肺的 就得到这么一句话
I pour my heart out, and that's all I get?

476
00:17:22,220 --> 00:17:24,338
有一次我爸跟我说了句"打得漂亮"
One time my dad said, "Nice game, kid."

477
00:17:24,338 --> 00:17:26,440
我的防光黑彩跟着眼泪一起往下流
I had eye black streaming down my cheeks,

478
00:17:26,440 --> 00:17:28,480
这一次我居然只得到一句"那好吧"
but all I get is, "Okay, then"?

479
00:17:28,820 --> 00:17:32,000
好吧 可能我平时该说但没怎么说
I mean, I-I probably don't say it as much as I should,

480
00:17:33,340 --> 00:17:34,640
但是我真的为你感到自豪 孩子
but I'm proud of you, kid.

481
00:17:35,080 --> 00:17:35,800
我知道了
Got it.

482
00:17:36,460 --> 00:17:37,898
-杰 -是丹啊
- Jay? - Hey, Dan!

483
00:17:37,898 --> 00:17:39,480
天哪 我没想到您会亲自出现
Gee, I didn't think you'd show up in person.

484
00:17:39,480 --> 00:17:41,880
克莱尔 这位就是重要人物丹·希格诺
Claire, this is the big cheese, Dan Signer.

485
00:17:42,060 --> 00:17:43,620
您好 希格诺先生 很高兴认识您
Hi, Mr. Signer. Such a pleasure to meet you.

486
00:17:43,620 --> 00:17:45,528
我为今天反反复复的态度向您道个歉
I'm so sorry about all that back and forth today.

487
00:17:45,528 --> 00:17:46,120
行了 让我来
Hey, I'll handle it from here.

488
00:17:46,120 --> 00:17:48,620
丹 我们很喜欢跟你们合作
Dan, we love doing business with you,

489
00:17:48,800 --> 00:17:51,000
但是这事跟克莱尔有关 我得坚定一点
but I gotta put my foot down when it comes to Claire.

490
00:17:51,680 --> 00:17:53,320
这是我的宝贝女儿
This is my little baby girl here.

491
00:17:53,320 --> 00:17:55,980
我一天之中最美好的时光
The best part of my day is having a coffee

492
00:17:55,980 --> 00:17:57,200
就是和她一起在休息室喝杯咖啡
with her in the break room,

493
00:17:57,860 --> 00:17:59,500
而且这之前没多久
and it wasn't that long ago

494
00:17:59,500 --> 00:18:01,480
她还坐在早餐桌前
that she was sitting at the breakfast table

495
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:05,220
吃着我给她做的心形华夫饼
eating heart-shaped waffles that I made for her.

496
00:18:05,320 --> 00:18:06,900
我告诉你 这简直让人哽咽
I tell ya, it puts a lump in your throat.

497
00:18:07,753 --> 00:18:08,669
不管怎么说吧
Anyway, uh,

498
00:18:08,669 --> 00:18:12,420
我不知道我凭什么成了最幸运的家伙
I don't know how I got to be the luckiest S.O.B. alive...

499
00:18:12,420 --> 00:18:16,160
但是只要我还有那么一点时日...
But if I have just even a few grains left in that hourglass...

500
00:18:16,260 --> 00:18:18,840
我就想用来跟...
I'm gonna be spending it with...

501
00:18:19,920 --> 00:18:22,000
我差点就把她的小名给说出来了
I almost just called her by her childhood nickname there.

502
00:18:23,164 --> 00:18:24,502
管他呢
Ah, what the hell?

503
00:18:25,735 --> 00:18:27,360
我的小福福兔宝宝
My little bunny foo-foo.

504
00:18:27,360 --> 00:18:29,840
-哦别说了 -我送你出去吧 丹
- Oh, no. - Let me walk you out, Dan.

505
00:18:29,840 --> 00:18:31,522
-兔宝宝 -感谢你的大驾光临
- Bunny! - Thanks for coming.

506
00:18:32,020 --> 00:18:32,320
兔宝宝
Bunny!

507
00:18:34,820 --> 00:18:35,840
谁是丹·希格诺
Who's Dan Signer?

508
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:37,320
我们不是要去俱乐部喝酒吗
I thought we were grabbing a beer at the club.

509
00:18:37,380 --> 00:18:38,360
只管向前走 梅奥
Just keep walking, Mel.

510
00:18:40,696 --> 00:18:42,420
那个 莉莉 你在忙吗
Uh, Lily, are you busy?

511
00:18:42,420 --> 00:18:42,900
看情况
Depends.

512
00:18:43,160 --> 00:18:45,900
我们想聊一聊关于感受的话题
Well, we wanted to have a little talk about feelings.

513
00:18:46,220 --> 00:18:48,862
好吧 其实我明天得交这份作业
Oh, actually, I have this project due tomorrow --

514
00:18:48,862 --> 00:18:50,500
好吧 亲爱的 收起来 没关系的
Okay, honey. No, no. It's okay. It's okay.

515
00:18:50,500 --> 00:18:51,320
坐下来
Let's just sit down.

516
00:18:51,560 --> 00:18:55,180
听着 我们只想问你觉不觉得我哭太多
Listen, we just wanted to ask if you think I cry too much.

517
00:18:55,440 --> 00:18:56,859
你可以说实话
And you can be honest.

518
00:18:56,859 --> 00:18:59,247
我不太想回答 不然你可能又要哭
I don't want to answer 'cause you might cry.

519
00:18:59,247 --> 00:19:00,482
好吧
Yeah, well...

520
00:19:00,560 --> 00:19:02,380
她是在乎我的感受的
She cares about my feelings!

521
00:19:02,920 --> 00:19:05,320
莉莉 我们觉得你不爱表达感情
Okay, Lily, we think that maybe you don't get emotional

522
00:19:05,320 --> 00:19:07,480
是因为大爸太多愁善感
because daddy gets, you know, so emotional

523
00:19:07,480 --> 00:19:08,619
因为他基本上扛起了
because he kind of handles

524
00:19:08,619 --> 00:19:10,860
-整个家的情绪 -确实
- the emotions for the entire house, you know? - I do.

525
00:19:10,880 --> 00:19:12,720
-可能是整个街区 -好吧
- Possibly the entire block. - Okay.

526
00:19:13,100 --> 00:19:15,480
可能因此你没有什么感情
And maybe that's why you don't feel anything.

527
00:19:15,660 --> 00:19:16,700
我有啊
I feel stuff.

528
00:19:16,700 --> 00:19:19,240
是吗 因为几周前 我们俩病了
Really? Because when we were sick a few weeks ago,

529
00:19:19,240 --> 00:19:20,340
你好像不怎么关心
You didn't seem to care.

530
00:19:20,500 --> 00:19:21,500
我是不关心啊
I didn't care.

531
00:19:21,620 --> 00:19:23,320
她没撒谎 我们起码做对了点事
Well, she's not a liar. We did something right.

532
00:19:24,280 --> 00:19:25,900
你不觉得你应该至少关心一下下吗
Don't you think you should have cared a little bit?

533
00:19:26,020 --> 00:19:27,340
为什么 反正你们都是会好起来的啊
Why? You always get better.

534
00:19:27,480 --> 00:19:29,320
好吧 以后就不一定了
Well... so far.

535
00:19:29,660 --> 00:19:31,059
"以后就不一定了"是什么意思
What do you mean, "So far"?

536
00:19:31,059 --> 00:19:32,560
呃 这个嘛
Um... well, uh...

537
00:19:32,560 --> 00:19:34,740
就是说有一天你们会好不起来了吗
Like someday, you're not gonna get better?

538
00:19:34,940 --> 00:19:36,080
你们会死吗
Like you're gonna die?

539
00:19:36,180 --> 00:19:39,040
不是 不不 很长时间内都不会的
No! No, no, no, no. Not, not for a very, very long time.

540
00:19:39,140 --> 00:19:41,220
那我们为什么现在要讨论这个
Then why are we talking about it now?

541
00:19:41,260 --> 00:19:42,360
是你先挑起来的好吧
Well, hey, you brought it up.

542
00:19:42,360 --> 00:19:43,560
我只是想确认一下
I just wanted to make sure that --

543
00:19:43,560 --> 00:19:45,080
别说了 你们说得我好难过
Stop! You're making me sad!

544
00:19:45,420 --> 00:19:47,000
好吧 她是有感情的
Okay, well, she has feelings.

545
00:19:47,240 --> 00:19:49,920
是啊 而且看起来她希望我们活着
Well, yes, and it seems that she wants to keep us alive.

546
00:19:50,040 --> 00:19:51,600
总而言之 今天的教育还是很成功的
So all in all, a good day of parenting.

547
00:19:51,860 --> 00:19:54,080
我不要跟克莱尔姨妈住
I don't want to live with aunt Claire!

548
00:19:54,720 --> 00:19:55,280
莉莉
Lily!

549
00:19:55,640 --> 00:19:58,520
父母在教育子女时总是犯很多错...
Parents make so many mistakes with their children...

550
00:20:00,313 --> 00:20:01,593
我还活着 亲爱的
I've alive, sweetheart.

551
00:20:01,776 --> 00:20:03,540
可是大爸呢
But what about daddy?

552
00:20:03,540 --> 00:20:05,106
我也还活着
I'm alive, too.

553
00:20:05,106 --> 00:20:06,140
过来 来吧 宝贝
Come here. Come on, sweetheart.

554
00:20:06,140 --> 00:20:08,680
但这也只是因为我们竭尽全力
But it's only because we're trying so hard

555
00:20:08,680 --> 00:20:09,720
想让他们过得快乐
to make them happy.

556
00:20:10,140 --> 00:20:12,100
她不行 她不行 我的天
Not her. Not her. Oh, my God.

557
00:20:12,100 --> 00:20:13,520
你要成为整所学校最漂亮的女孩了
You're gonna be the cutest girl at this whole school.

558
00:20:13,824 --> 00:20:15,357
等等 这些是女孩子吧
Wait, these are girls, right?

559
00:20:19,300 --> 00:20:21,800
竭尽全力把他们留在身边...
Trying so hard to keep them close...

560
00:20:24,320 --> 00:20:25,460
你该敲下门的
You could knock.

561
00:20:25,820 --> 00:20:27,700
尽管知道总有一天留不住
even though we know we can't.

562
00:20:28,080 --> 00:20:30,560
我知道将来我要把你交到别的女人手上
I know someday I'm gonna lose you to another woman,

563
00:20:30,560 --> 00:20:32,680
但是我会想办法接受的
and I'll find a way to be okay with it.

564
00:20:32,900 --> 00:20:33,820
谢谢你 凯莉
Thanks, Kylie.

565
00:20:35,380 --> 00:20:36,520
但今天不会
But not today.

566
00:20:38,540 --> 00:20:40,117
接着我走进他的办公室
So, I walk into his office

567
00:20:40,117 --> 00:20:41,760
他在看我的照片
he's looking at a picture of me

568
00:20:41,760 --> 00:20:42,720
而且在哭
and he's crying.

569
00:20:42,900 --> 00:20:43,340
你爸吗
Your dad?

570
00:20:43,400 --> 00:20:44,380
是啊 我都不敢相信
Yeah, I couldn't believe it either.

571
00:20:44,860 --> 00:20:46,460
这也是为何我很乐意在女儿面前
This is why I'm glad that I show my emotions

572
00:20:46,460 --> 00:20:47,257
表达我的感受
in front of the girls.

573
00:20:47,257 --> 00:20:48,493
-我觉得这就是为什么... -菲尔
- I think that's the reason that feeling... - Phill,

574
00:20:48,493 --> 00:20:50,560
我们能不能在炉子热起来之前
can we at least have my story

575
00:20:50,560 --> 00:20:51,540
先听完我的故事
until the oven preheats?

576
00:20:51,760 --> 00:20:52,880
对不起 我以为你说完了
Sorry, I thought you were finished.

577
00:20:53,640 --> 00:20:55,740
好吧 后来我又去了一趟他的办公室
Okay, so, anyway, I went back later and it turns out

578
00:20:55,740 --> 00:20:56,840
原来他没有在哭
he wasn't crying,

579
00:20:57,020 --> 00:20:59,100
他是在拔他的鼻毛
he was plucking his nose hairs.

580
00:20:59,280 --> 00:21:00,300
我可没想到
I didn't expect that.

581
00:21:00,860 --> 00:21:01,508
是啊 我也想不到
Yeah, me neither.

582
00:21:01,508 --> 00:21:03,120
能走进那间影院
To walk into that theatre and see

583
00:21:03,120 --> 00:21:04,239
然后看着她们的小脑袋靠在一起
their cute little heads together

584
00:21:04,239 --> 00:21:06,321
就在她们吵了一下午的架之后
after they had been fighting all afternoon.

585
00:21:06,620 --> 00:21:08,506
拜托 你刚才绝对算是说完了
Come on, you had to be done that time.

586
00:21:08,506 --> 00:21:10,361
没有 这是我的问题吗
No, is it me?

587
00:21:10,680 --> 00:21:12,420
是我讲故事的方式有问题吗
Is it the way that I tell stories?

588
00:21:12,540 --> 00:21:15,140
是我太闷还是这个家里的所有人
Am I so boring or is everyone in this family

589
00:21:15,140 --> 00:21:16,540
就只关心自己
that self-involved.

590
00:21:17,080 --> 00:21:18,277
接着我刚没说完的
As I was saying

591
00:21:18,277 --> 00:21:20,836
她叫埃莲娜 来自北卡罗莱纳州
Her name was Elena and she's from North Carolina.

592
00:21:20,836 --> 00:21:22,574
这就是我的室友
That's my roomate.

593
00:21:22,760 --> 00:21:23,820
现在我说完了
Now I'm done.
